d enjoyment. Conveniently located near Thrifty Foods, Save-On-Foods, Shoppers Drug Mart, Capilano Mall, parks, cafés, restaurants, and the City Library. The Shipyards in Lower Lonsdale, SeaBus, transit, and major commuter routes are all easily accessible. Tenant insurance required at move-in. Move-in fee $100 payable to Strata VS1418. (id:67604)"},"30162103":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639225054655500000/reb6/highres/1/R3156171_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639225054655500000/reb6/highres/1/R3156171_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639225054655500000/reb6/highres/1/R3156171_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639225054655500000/reb6/highres/1/R3156171_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639225054655500000/reb6/highres/1/R3156171_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639225054655500000/reb6/highres/1/R3156171_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639225054655500000/reb6/highres/1/R3156171_7.jpg"],"remarks":"Unique 1 bedroom basement suite in a great Royal Heights neighourhood. This suite features: custom kitchen with high end stainless appliances, bathroom with custom glass shower and designer cabinets. Washer and dryer to be shared with the upper tenant. Large storage shed in the backyard for the basement tenant. No pets or smokers please. Utilities (hydro, gas, water, sewer) to be split with the upper tenant. (id:67604)"},"30197527":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639232882539430000/reb89/highres/3/R3158883_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639232882539430000/reb89/highres/3/R3158883_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639232882539430000/reb89/highres/3/R3158883_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639232882539430000/reb89/highres/3/R3158883_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639232882539430000/reb89/highres/3/R3158883_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639232882539430000/reb89/highres/3/R3158883_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listi