/TS639241164243300000/reb89/highres/7/R3161537_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639241164243300000/reb89/highres/7/R3161537_8.jpg"],"remarks":"PROPERTY FEATURES: - One bright bedroom to rent in a shared 4B3B. 3 bedrooms share 2 full bathrooms - Unit size 1300 sqf, room size 200sqf - Build in kitchen Appliances - Washer/Dryer - Central air conditioner - Furnished - Free monthly cleaning, WIFI included.  SHOWING: ***DO NOT CALL*** Please LEAVE YOUR CONTACT INFO and brief self-introduction, by texting to the Luxmore Realty at 778 558 7781 - Reply code \"1XX West Wind\" - Contact information (name, email, phone) - Number of people who will move in (student or family) - Occupation and annual income - Expected move-in date - Estimated length of rent - Reason for moving - Any pet? (id:67604)"},"30325879":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639258767112930000/reb89/highres/2/R3169492_16.jpg"],"remarks":"Bright and spacious unfurnished 2-bedroom + den, 2-bathroom corner suite featuring an open-concept layout with plenty of room for house-sized furniture.The thoughtfully designed floor plan offers excellent separation between the bedrooms and bathrooms for added privacy. Additional features include in-suite laundry, one secure underground parking stall, one storage locker, and pets permitted with restrictions, subject to owner approval. Ideally located just steps from Douglas Park and within easy reach of Vancouver General Hospital, excellent schools, shops, restaurants, and transit. Pallet Coffee Roasters is conveniently located across the street, with Downtown Vancouver, Kitsilano, Queen Elizabeth Park, and False Creek all nearby. **Available December 1** Minimum 12-month lease preferred. (id:67604)"},"30380071":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270539040400000/reb89/highres/4/R3173684_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270539040400000/reb89/highres/4/R3173684_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270539040400000/reb89/highres/4/R3173684_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270539040400000/reb89/highres/4/R3173684_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270539040400000/reb89/highres/4/R3173684_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270539040400000/reb89/highres/4/R3173684_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270539040400000/reb89/highres/4/R3173684_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270539040400000/reb89/highres/4/R3173684_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270539040400000/reb89/highres/4/R3173684_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639270539040400000/reb89/highres/4/R3173684_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.c